  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Platya%27s_Gift?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Platya's Gift</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Event_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Event Quests\">Event Quests</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Event</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Flaming_Red_in_Memory\" title=\"The Flaming Red in Memory\">The Flaming Red in Memory</a>[[Category:|000000]]</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Miko%27s_Preferences\" title=\"A Miko&#39;s Preferences\">A Miko's Preferences</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">N/A</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lucilla\" title=\"Lucilla\">Lucilla</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Platya\" title=\"Platya\">Platya</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Platya's Gift</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Event_Quest\" title=\"Event Quest\">Event Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Square\" title=\"Square\">Square</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Startorch_Academy_(Region)\" title=\"Startorch Academy (Region)\">Startorch Academy (Region)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Roya_Frostlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Roya Frostlands\">Roya Frostlands</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Talk to Platya</li>\n<li>Find Lucilla</li>\n<li>Talk to Lucilla</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Platya)</dt>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> ...So tired. So, so tired.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Those are some serious dark circles.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> Yeah, yeah... (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), here. Please give this to the Lady Miko for me.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Did you stay up all night?</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> ...Hehe. Yeah, I've never baked before, and my hand-eye coordination isn't great, so... it took quite a few tries to get it right.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> But don't worry! I'm really proud of the final look and taste.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> And... from everything I've learned about her these past few days, I don't think she'd like anything too strong or overly sweet.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> So I asked an Academy mech to dig through the archives. Found this ingredient that tones down the sweetness. Makes it taste lighter, more balanced.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Leave its delivery to me then.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> Thank you. I guess... this is goodbye for now. After today's schedule wraps up, I'm heading back to the Black Shores.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> I hope everything goes well for you at Startorch. Really.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Find Lucilla)</dt>\n<dt>(Talk to Lucilla)</dt>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> This memory... is redudant. I'll erase that...</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Oh? (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;). Here for some life advice? Come to chat with the President?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> It's about that miko.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> She reached out to you, huh? I told her she shouldn't be going underground anymore. Seems she's acting on her own anyway.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> You don't plan to misbehave too, do you?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> (Hand Lucilla the gift from Platya.)</dd>\n<dd><b>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;):</b> That's not why I'm here. The Exostrider is critical not just to the Collective, but to all of Lahai-Roi. I wouldn't act without authorization. Not for \"my own\" sake.</dd>\n<dd><b>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;):</b> This is a gift from someone the miko once protected. Handmade. Think you could pass it to her?</dd>\n<dd><b>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;):</b> And tell her I do want to save Aemeath. More than anything. But I don't want anyone else getting hurt for it either.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Hah... You two might actually get along. Which is saying something. Hiyuki doesn't exactly do small talk.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Both of you have a \"savior complex.\" As an educator, I'm here to tell you that isn't a good thing.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> At any rate, I'll make sure your friend's gift reaches her. And your request to activate the Exostrider... Fine. I'll see what I can do.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> I've already set a timeline with Hiyuki. This next trip is the last one the Collective is authorizing.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> That also means, until your own request is approved, you wait. Okay?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I understand.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Oh, and one correction. It's not just for \"your own\" sake. It's for \"my student.\" And more so, for \"everyone Aleph-1 ever hurt.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> The Voidmatter in the Dimmr Plains beneath Lahai-Roi is growing increasingly unstable. We don't have much time... Go on. When I have news, I'll contact you.</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Platya's Gift</td></tr></tbody></table> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/3.2\" title=\"Version/3.2\">Version 3.2</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Platya%27s_Gift/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=3.2&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Platya%26%2339%3Bs+Gift\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div></div>",
